		<div class="big_kg">
			<BR><span class="span_title">News</span>
			<div class="box_xian"></div>
    <div class="content_1"><span class="span_con"><strong>Good News: <strong><span class="STYLE2">Sponsored by IEEE Communications Society, the 5<sup>th</sup> International Conference on Intelligent Computing and Next Generation Networks (ICNGN 2026) has been listed on
						the official website of IEEE with the ID 72925:</span> <a class="news_a1"
							href="https://conferences.ieee.org/conferences_events/conferences/conferencedetails/72925">https://conferences.ieee.org/conferences_events/conferences/conferencedetails/72925</a></strong><br>
      Good News: All papers of ICNGN 2025 Conference Proceedings</a> have been indexed in EI and Scopus successfully! <br>
    Good News: <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/conhome/11412344/proceeding">ICNGN 2025 Conference Proceedings</a> has been published officially in IEEE Xplore! <br>
				Good News: ICNGN 2026 is scheduled to be held from December
				12-14, 2026 in Hong Kong, China!<br>
				Good News: ICNGN 2025 has been held successfully in Singapore from December
				12-14, 2025!<br>
				<br>
				    <img src="img/2025/Group Photo.jpg" width="645" height="310" alt="ICNGN conference group photo"> <img
								src="img/2025/Online Photo.png" width="703" height="310" alt="ICNGN online conference participants"><br>
			    </strong><br>
    </span>			</div>

			<br>
			<h1 class="span_title">ICNGN 2026</h1>
			<div class="box_xian"></div>
			<div class="content_1">
				<br>
				<span class="span_con">
					<strong>Building on the success of previous editions, the 5<sup>th</sup> International Conference on
						Intelligent Computing and Next Generation
						Networks (ICNGN 2026) is scheduled to be held from December 12-14, 2026, in Hong Kong, China.</strong><br>
						<br>

					<strong> Since its inception in 2022 in Hangzhou, China, ICNGN has developed into an international forum for researchers, engineers, and industry professionals to exchange ideas and present the latest advances in intelligent computing and next-generation network technologies. The conference has steadily expanded its international participation and academic influence over the years.<br>
					<br>
					In 2023, the conference, supported by IEEE (ID 59831), took place in Hangzhou once again. Sponsored by IEEE Communications Society, ICNGN 2024 was was marked by fruitful discussions and productive outcomes in Bangkok, Thailand. Continuing with the support of the IEEE Communications Society, ICNGN 2025 was successfully held in Singapore, further expanding the conference's international reach and academic impact.<br>
					<br>
					Continuing the strong support of the IEEE Communications Society, ICNGN 2026 will once again serve as a premier platform for researchers, academics, and industry professionals to present innovative research, exchange ideas, and foster collaborations in intelligent computing and next-generation network technologies.</strong><br>
				    <br>
				    <strong>We warmly welcome researchers, practitioners, and students from around the world to join us in Hong Kong!</strong></span><br>
				<span class="span_title">Hong Kong, China | December 12-14, 2026</span>
			</div>

			<div class="box_xian"></div>
		  <div class="content_1">
				<br>
		    <span class="span_con">
				  <strong>The conference will feature a variety of academic activities, including:</strong> <br>
				  <br>
		    <strong>· Keynote Speeches <br>
				  · Invited Speeches<br>
					  · Oral Presentations<br>
			    · Poster presentations</strong><br>
			    <br>
					  <strong>ICNGN 2026 welcomes original research contributions covering both theoretical advances and practical applications in intelligent computing and next-generation networks.</strong><br>
				  <br>
		    <strong><span class="STYLE2">Sponsored by IEEE Communications Society, ICNGN 2026 has been listed on the official website of IEEE with the ID 72925.</span> All accepted papers, after successful registration and presentation, will be included in the ICNGN 2026 Conference Proceedings and submitted for inclusion in IEEE Xplore, EI Compendex, and Scopus.<br>
				    <br>
				    We sincerely look forward to your participation and contributions to ICNGN 2026.<br>
				    <br>
		    </strong>			  </span>			</div>


			<a style="margin: 40px auto;" class="submit_paper" href="https://www.discoverhongkong.com/">Hong Kong, China</a>

			<span class="span_title"><strong>Conference Support</strong></span>
